{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/2f82bb04835797bb107928203426c4fa.poster.avif?t=1764626867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/2f82bb04835797bb107928203426c4fa.webm?t=1764626867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/2f82bb04835797bb107928203426c4fa.mp4?t=1764626867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Intense and Satisfying Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience precision-based battles through a fast, responsive combat system where every encounter feels like an epic duel. Chain your strikes with explosive spells, blend close and ranged attacks seamlessly, and unlock new abilities to refine your own fighting style in a system that rewards timing, aggression, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defy the Corruption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Envoy rules a dying world, twisting faith into control and life into obedience. Everything here wants you dead; the corrupted, the devout, and the forsaken alike. Defy his will, cut through the decay, and rise against the darkness consuming what\u2019s left of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Fallen World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the remnants of a dying realm, a world scarred by corruption and war, where every region tells its own story of survival and decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new enemies and powerful foes across the ruined lands, each guarding secrets buried beneath the ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet wanderers, mercenaries, and survivors walking the same path. Stand together against a world that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving land, every step is a battle for survival.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120090?t=1764626867","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120090?t=1764626867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/313e0c347522ae34ba34867f61487087621d5b73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764626867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/313e0c347522ae34ba34867f61487087621d5b73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764626867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work.\r\n\r\nFrequent Violence or Gore, Strong Language, Some Nudity, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/2f82bb04835797bb107928203426c4fa.poster.avif?t=1764626867\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/2f82bb04835797bb107928203426c4fa.webm?t=1764626867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/2f82bb04835797bb107928203426c4fa.mp4?t=1764626867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Intense and Satisfying Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience precision-based battles through a fast, responsive combat system where every encounter feels like an epic duel. Chain your strikes with explosive spells, blend close and ranged attacks seamlessly, and unlock new abilities to refine your own fighting style in a system that rewards timing, aggression, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defy the Corruption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Envoy rules a dying world, twisting faith into control and life into obedience. Everything here wants you dead; the corrupted, the devout, and the forsaken alike. Defy his will, cut through the decay, and rise against the darkness consuming what\u2019s left of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Fallen World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the remnants of a dying realm, a world scarred by corruption and war, where every region tells its own story of survival and decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new enemies and powerful foes across the ruined lands, each guarding secrets buried beneath the ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet wanderers, mercenaries, and survivors walking the same path. Stand together against a world that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving land, every step is a battle for survival.</p>","developers":["Howl Craft Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/bcbd1b3c446099398d1b2245f9ba89d38377996a/header.jpg?t=1764626867","is_free"